  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inga 3  Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Inga 3 Development Program MPA (I3DP MPA) is the centerpiece of the World Bank&apos;s approach to help the DRC turn Inga&apos;s hydropower resources into economic transformation. Based on experiences of large transformational programs in other parts of the world the I3DP MPA will address two challenges simultaneously: a.	Help the Government prepare the Project for the Country: preparing the variety of studies, technical assistance, and investments required to launch the construction of the Inga 3 hydropower project in a manner consistent with the further development of the Inga site.b.	Help the Government prepare the Country for the Program: preparing a range of studies, investments, reforms, and capacity building around the Inga site, along the Inga Growth Corridor, and at the national level; all of which will be required to help the DRC both prepare the ground for Inga 3&apos;s development and prepare to capture the broad-based benefits and economic transformation that Inga 3 will bring to the country, the region and the planet&apos;s population.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop the capacities and plans for Government to sustainably develop Inga 3, an associated economic growth corridor, and improve services for selected communities close to Inga.</narrative>
  </description>
